[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
artifacts/

## Crash diagnostics written beside the executable
crash.log

## Placed by the build on a case-sensitive filesystem; a case-insensitive checkout cannot hold it
## apart from tests/Capsule.BuildProof/casevariant/Drivers/. Named as a file rather than a
## directory: git folds case here too, and the directory form would also ignore the committed
## marked sibling.
/tests/Capsule.BuildProof/casevariant/drivers/CaseVariantDriver.cs

